---
title: Books
description: The books Mike Street has read recently, pulled from Goodreads.
layout: page.njk
permalink: /books/
---

<h1>Books</h1>
<p>The books I've finished, most recent first, from <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/">Goodreads</a>.</p>

{% if books.length %}
<ol class="books">
	{% for book in books %}
	<li class="book">
		<a href="{{ book.url }}">
			<img src="{{ book.cover }}" alt="Cover of {{ book.title }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="200" height="300">
		</a>
		<h2 class="book-title"><a href="{{ book.url }}">{{ book.title }}</a></h2>
		<p class="book-author">{{ book.author }}</p>
		<p class="book-date"><time datetime="{{ book.date }}">{{ book.date | dateLong }}</time></p>
	</li>
	{% endfor %}
</ol>
{% else %}
<p>No books yet.</p>
{% endif %}
